wip/py-skia-pathops: Import py-skia-pathops-0.9.2

skia-pathops: Python bindings to Skia's path operations (union,
intersection, difference, xor, simplify).  The sdist bundles the Skia
sources; a minimal static libskia is built with gn (wip/gn-git) and
ninja instead of the downloaded virtualenv/ninja/gn of setup.py.
Needed by ManimGL's boolean operations (wip/py-manimgl).
